.TH "RAPTOR-HEALTH" 1 "2026-10" "RAPTOR Studio" "RAPTOR Studio Manual"
.SH NAME
raptor\-health \- summarise a model's size, completeness and issues
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBraptor health\fR [\-h] [\-f {text,json}] MODEL
.SH DESCRIPTION
Project health: element counts, validation findings, unnamed elements, duplicate block names and unused pools.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Options
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR \fI{text|json}\fR
output format (default text)
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBraptor\fR(1)
